  m_text: "There are enemies above this wall!\n\nThey are easily distracted by lures.\n\npress
    the button to open the door.\n\nit should be fairly obvious what to do next.\n\nyou
    have 3 loops to complete each level.\n\nwhen you loop, the map remains \nexactly
    as it was but\nyou get reset back to your spawn\n\nPS: the enemies blink red
    occasionally\nuse this to see their location!!\n\nalso green doors have a \n5
    second delay when opening"
